<p class="home-care-door"><strong>And if you hold people together for a living</strong> — if you nurse, teach, parent, care, organise — the project has a question it owes you and has under-served for three cycles, now written down as its fourteenth test. Start at the <a href="{{ '/logs/open_questions/' | url }}">open questions</a>; the register of care is the one it most needs a real outside voice to correct.</p>

